@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F0F5FA
skinparam stateBorderColor #4D6F91
skinparam ArrowColor #536477
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam nodesep 32
top to bottom direction

state "受理求助" as Intake
state "等待产品确认" as Product
state "分析与选择下一步" as Triage
state "等待用户操作" as Action
state "等待必要复测" as Verify
state "等待人工接单" as Queue
state "人工处理中" as Human
state "会话关闭" as Closed

[*] --> Intake
Intake --> Product : 产品不明确
Product --> Triage : 用户确认
Intake --> Triage : 产品已明确
Triage --> Action : 发布审核步骤
Action --> Triage : 新操作反馈
Triage --> Verify : 仍缺验证条件
Verify --> Triage : 新观察或复测反馈
Triage --> Queue : 用户确认交接
Queue --> Human : 真人实际接单
Human --> Triage : 明确归还自动流程
Triage --> Closed : 记录结果与关闭原因
Human --> Closed : 记录处理结果
Closed --> Intake : 有权限地重新打开

note bottom of Closed
会话关闭不等于修复成功。
结果等级另存：用户自述、局部观察、
限定规程支持、待验证或未解决。
end note
@enduml
